.git
.idea
.claude-flow
**/target/**
!**/target/quarkus-app/**
# Re-include the directory itself too. Docker's classic builder, which Cloud Build's docker
# step uses, matches `**/target/**` against target/quarkus-app as a path, and the pattern
# above matches only what is inside it, so without this line the whole fast-jar is left
# out of the build context and the image's COPY finds nothing. BuildKit is unaffected.
!**/target/quarkus-app
*.md
